### Create a Health Care Facility
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/health-care-facilities
Authorization: {{AdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

 {
    "firstName": "Khaled",
    "lastName": "Clinic",
  "Email": "khaled.clinic@example.com",
  "Password": "12er56ui90MO@",
    "name": "khaled",
    "type": 0,
    "street": "220 Coastal Rd",
    "city": "Tartus",
    "state": "Tartus Governorate",
    "country": "Syria",
    "zipCode": "49005",
    "gpsLatitude": 34.887,
    "gpsLongitude": 35.8869
  }

###
POST http://localhost:5001/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Email": "khaled.clinic@example.com",
  "Password": "12er56ui90MO@"
}





### create Doctor

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/health-care-facilities/me/doctors
Authorization: {{HelathCare}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "John",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "email": "do.doe@example.com",
    "password": "password123",
    "gender": 1,
    "dateOfBirth": "1985-05-15",
    "specialization": 2,
    "licenseNumber": "MED123456"
}








### get doctors 
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health-care-facilities/me/doctors
Authorization: {{HelathCare}}

### get doctor by id


GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health-care-facilities/me/doctors/{{doctorId}}
Authorization: {{HelathCare}}


